@startuml lld-us1-sequence
title LLD-US1 Log in with customer ID and password: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant LoginController
participant AuthService
participant CustomerRepo
Browser -> LoginController : POST /login
LoginController -> AuthService : checkPassword()
AuthService -> CustomerRepo : find(10023456)
CustomerRepo --> AuthService : hash
AuthService --> LoginController : true
LoginController --> Browser : 302 to OTP page
@enduml